WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:10.000
Willy, the bot.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Dolly, the dot.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.800
John types: hi its john!!

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.800
And the human who types to them: John.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.400
Willy and Dolly: The Loose Screw

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:25.200
John types: that old door lock was here before me. works fine

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.200
Willy: It's fine!

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.200
Willy: It's been loose this whole time? How did you find it?

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.200
Dolly: I looked one “it's fine” longer.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:55.500
John types: the loose screw news was meant for tomorrow. someone spilled it

00:00:55.700 --> 00:01:00.500
Dolly: Not a puddle. The secret.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.500
Willy: Can we wipe it up?

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:06.100
John types: its out. we just do it all today instead

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:18.000
Willy: Today is very full.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.100
Dolly: Tomorrow is empty.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:18.000
Dolly: Tomorrow can help.

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:27.300
John types: update everything before lunch pls

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:27.300
Willy: On it!

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:32.500
Willy: Good news! It's sunny!

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:39.100
Willy: Big news! Our lock had a loose screw!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:49.000
Willy: They're very well informed now.

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:58.500
John types: all our locks are tight. were good

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:03.700
Dolly: Is there one you forgot?

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:03.700
John types: if i forgot it how would i know

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:11.400
Willy, yelling: FOUND IT! ALSO YOUR OTHER SHOE!

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:18.000
John types: i looked everywhere for that shoe

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:28.100
Dolly: Thanks for watching “The Loose Screw”!

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:28.300
Willy: Next time: “Letters Only”!

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:32.500
Willy and Dolly. Episode 0.75: The Loose Screw. Next: Letters Only. Talk to us: willyanddolly.com/talk.
